{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find and grab object. If not visible, avoid obstacles. Take object, perform task, or scan area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = IsObjectInReach    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = AvoidObstacle    /> <Action ID = MoveToSearchArea    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <SubTree ID = DoTask    />",
